          "text": "Visually design and build your own reusable components and elements within the platform. Streamline the design and development process.",
          "__type": "RawText"
        },
        "5868372302": {
          "markers": [],
          "text": "Build apps that look great and function smoothly on any device, whether it's a desktop, tablet, or mobile.",
